// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
//  ZAFIRA TILI - Muhit va Sana/Vaqt (std.env & std.datetime) Namunasi
//  Fayl: env_datetime_test.zf
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

import std.env
import std.datetime

print("==================================================")
print("   ZAFIRA MUHIT VA SANA/VAQT MODULLARI SINOVI     ")
print("==================================================")

// ─── 1. STD.ENV SINOVI ───
print("\n>>> 1. STD.ENV (Muhit O'zgaruvchilari va Tizim) <<<")

// 1.1 OS va joriy ishchi katalog
let tizim = env.os()
let katalog = env.cwd()
print("Operatsion tizim: " + tizim)
print("Joriy katalog: " + katalog)

// 1.2 CLI argumentlar
let argumentlar = env.args()
print("CLI argumentlar soni: " + String(argumentlar.len))

// 1.3 Muhit o'zgaruvchisi o'rnatish va tekshirish
print("\nYangi muhit o'zgaruvchisi o'rnatilmoqda: APP_MODE=production")
env.set("APP_MODE", "production")
let mavjud = env.has("APP_MODE")
print("APP_MODE mavjudmi: " + String(mavjud))

let qiymat = env.get("APP_MODE", "mavjud_emas")
print("APP_MODE qiymati: " + String(qiymat))

// 1.4 Mavjud bo'lmagan o'zgaruvchi va default qiymat
let noma_lum = env.get("NON_EXISTING_ZAFIRA_VAR", "standart_qiymat")
print("Topilmagan o'zgaruvchi (default bilan): " + String(noma_lum))

// 1.5 O'zgaruvchini o'chirish
print("\nAPP_MODE o'chirilmoqda...")
env.remove("APP_MODE")
let keyin_mavjud = env.has("APP_MODE")
print("O'chirilgandan so'ng mavjudmi: " + String(keyin_mavjud))

// ─── 2. STD.DATETIME SINOVI ───
print("\n>>> 2. STD.DATETIME (Sana va Vaqt) <<<")

// 2.1 Joriy sana va vaqt (DateTime struktura)
let vaqt = datetime.now()
print("Yil:    " + String(vaqt.year))
print("Oy:     " + String(vaqt.month))
print("Kun:    " + String(vaqt.day))
print("Soat:   " + String(vaqt.hour))
print("Daqiqa: " + String(vaqt.minute))
print("Soniya: " + String(vaqt.second))
print("ISO format: " + vaqt.iso)

// 2.2 Unix timestamp
let ts = datetime.timestamp()
print("\nUnix timestamp (soniyalarda): " + String(ts))

// 2.3 Sana/vaqtni formatlash
let sana_format = datetime.format(null, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")
print("Joriy vaqt formatlangan: " + sana_format)

let sana_qisqa = datetime.format(ts, "%Y/%m/%d")
print("Timestamp formatlangan:  " + sana_qisqa)

// 2.4 Kechiktirish (sleep_ms)
print("\n50 millisoniya kutish (sleep_ms)...")
datetime.sleep_ms(50)
print("Kutish muvaffaqiyatli yakunlandi!")

print("\n==================================================")
print("  STD.ENV VA STD.DATETIME SINOVI TUGADI (100% OK) ")
print("==================================================")
